          "en": "and that you take a look at the next core section",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 151.47,
          "end": 154.53,
          "en": "where I give you a JavaScript refresher.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 154.53,
          "end": 156.39,
          "en": "In the end in this code as mentioned,",
