        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 357.48,
          "end": 360.54,
          "en": "And later in the course, you will also learn how to set",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 360.54,
          "end": 363.54,
          "en": "up such a React project locally on your system",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 363.54,
          "end": 367.95,
